  <LocalizationPair Name="%Deeds_Regular_EmpireDevelopment_Stage5_C_WD-Title">民安国泰</LocalizationPair>
  <LocalizationPair Name="%Deeds_Regular_EmpireDevelopment_Stage5_C_WD-Description">很多文明或许传遍了群星，但它们的公民快乐吗？让你的帝国沿着顺天应民的路线发展——心满意足的公民才会温和驯顺。</LocalizationPair>
  <LocalizationPair Name="%Deeds_Regular_EmpireDevelopment_Stage5_C_WD-Objective">率先让你的帝国达到$HappinessObjectiveName [happinessColored]。</LocalizationPair>
